'''Bronze Vampire's Edge''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''3rd''' on the [[Halloween Event 2020]] Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Bronze Vampire's Edge has the same design as [[Vampire's Edge]], but with bronze ridges instead of red ridges.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players could collect as many [[Candies (2020)|Candies]] (acts exactly like [[coins]] but Halloween-exclusive) and score points which will determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*When this item first came out on December 13th, 2020, it displayed as a [[Godly Weapons|godly]], and was fixed roughly an hour later.
*Other variants of this include [[Blue Vampire's Edge]], [[Silver Vampire's Edge]], and [[Gold Vampire's Edge|Gold Vampire's Edge.]]
*This item is a bronze reskin of [[Vampire's Edge]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this item is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/112733296/profile GalaxyPhoenixFlames].'''
*The revamped version of this item was uploaded on January 23rd, 2023.

